$DATUM One-pot Synthesis of 7b. Boc-Hydrazine (0.205 g, 0.00155 mol) was
dissolved in 10 ml of EtOH and 0.5 ml of water and heated to reflux.
2-(Methylthio)acetaldehyde dimethyl acetal (0.211 g, 0.00155 mol) was
added, followed by the addition of 5 μl (8 mg, 0.07 mmol) of TFA. The
reaction mixture was heated to reflux and the progress of the reaction
monitored by TLC using ethyl acetate/light petroleum (1:2) as eluent
until complete conversion of both reagents (Rf = 0.18 for Boc-NHNH2; Rf =
0.86 for 2-(methylthio)acetaldehyde dimethyl acetal). After the reaction
was complete, acetic acid (0.28 g, 0.00465 mol) was added, followed by
addition of NaBH3CN (0.284 g, 0.00465 mol). The reaction mixture was
stirred at room temperature until full conversion of hydrazone. After the
reaction was complete, excess of acetic acid was neutralized with
saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution, and reaction mixture was boiled for 2
hours. The solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure and the residue
was dissolved in ethyl acetate, washed with saturated NaHCO3, twice with
H2O and finally with saturated NaCl solution. The aqueous phase was
extracted twice with ethyl acetate and the extracts were washed with
saturated NaCl and combined with the organic phase, dried over anhydrous
Na2SO4, and the solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure. The
residue was purified by column chromatography on silica gel using ethyl
acetate/light petroleum (1:1) as eluent to give the product.
N-tert-Butyloxycarbonyl-N'-(2-methylthio)ethylhydrazine (7b), Yield:
(0.182 g, 57%), white needles. mp. 42-45°C, identical with the product
obtained above. 1H NMR (200 MHz; CDCl3): δ 1.46 (s, 9H, 3× CH3); 2.12 (s,
3H, CH3); 2.62 (t, 2H, J = 6.6 Hz, CH2); 3.05 (t, 2H, J = 6.6 Hz, CH2);
4.31 (br s, 1H, NH); 6.78 (br.s, 1H, NH). 13C NMR δ 15.3; 28.4; 32.3;
50.2; 80.4; 156.8. IR: 3307.3; 2975.8; 2917.8; 1700.0. LRMS: m/z for
C8H18N2O2S [M + H]+ Calcd: 207.1. Found: 207.0. HRMS: m/z for C8H18N2O2S
[M + H]+: Calcd: 207.1161. Found: 207.1159. Anal. Calcd for C8H18N2O2S:
C, 46.57; H, 8.79; N, 13.58; S, 15.54. Found: C, 46.68; H, 8.72; N,
13.64; S, 15.59.
