$DATUM One-pot Synthesis of 7a: Fmoc-Hydrazine (0.14 g, 0.00055 mol) was
suspended in 10 ml of EtOH and 0.5 ml of water and heated to reflux.
2-(Methylthio)acetaldehyde dimethyl acetal (75 mg, 0.55 mmol) was added,
followed by the addition of 5 μl (8 mg, 0.07 mmol) of TFA. The reaction
mixture was heated to reflux and the progress of the reaction was
monitored by TLC using ethyl acetate/light petroleum (1:2) as eluent
until complete conversion of both reagents (Rf = 0.17 for Fmoc-NHNH2; Rf
= 0.86 for 2-(methylthio)acetaldehyde dimethyl acetal). After the
reaction was complete, the reaction mixture was cooled to the room
temperature and acetic acid (0.1 g, 1.65 mmol) was added, followed by
addition of NaBH3CN (104 mg, 1.65 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred
at room temperature until complete reduction of the hydrazone. After the
reaction was complete, excess of acetic acid was neutralized by saturated
aqueous NaHCO3 and the reaction mixture was heated at a reflux for 2 h.
The solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure and the residue was
dissolved in ethyl acetate, washed with saturated NaHCO3, twice with H2O
and finally with saturated NaCl solution. The aqueous phase was extracted
twice with ethyl acetate and the extracts were washed with saturated NaCl
and combined with the organic phase, dried over anhydrous Na2SO4, and the
solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure. The residue was purified
by column chromatography on silica gel using ethyl acetate/light
petroleum (1:1) as eluent.
N-Fluorenylmethyloxycarbonyl-N'-(2-methylthio)ethylhydrazine (7a), Yield:
(0.095 g, 53%), white solid. mp. 132-136°C, identical to the product
obtained above. 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3): δ 2.09 (s, 3H, CH3); 2.58 (t,
2H, J = 6.6 Hz, CH2); 3.04 (t, 2H, J = 6.6 Hz, CH2); 4.20 (t + br s, 2H,
J = 6.2 Hz, CH (Fmoc) + NH); 4.46 (d, 2H, J = 6.2 Hz, CH2 (Fmoc)); 6.50
(br.s, 1H, NH); 7.26-7.42 (m, 5H, Ar(H)), 7.56 (d, 2H, J = 7.2 Hz,
Ar(H)), 7.76 (q, 2H, J = 6.8 Hz, Ar(H)). 13C NMR: δ 15.5; 32.5; 47.5;
50.1; 67.2; 120.2; 125.2; 127.3; 128.0; 141.6; 143.9; 157.5. IR: 3301.1;
3221.8; 3099.4; 2936.7; 1693.6. LRMS: m/z for C18H20N2O2S [M + H]+:
Calcd: 329.1. Found: 329.0. HRMS: m/z for C18H20N2O2S [M + H]+: Calcd:
329.1318. Found: 329.1315. Anal. Calcd for C18H20N2O2S: C, 65.83; H,
6.14; N, 8.53; S, 9.76. Found: C, 65.86; H, 6.17; N, 8.46; S, 9.75.
