$DATUM Methyl
(2R)-2-{(3S)-3-[4-(benzyloxy)phenyl]-3-methyl-2-oxo-1-pyrrolidinyl}propanoate
(8) To an ice-water bath cooled (5-10°C) mixture of 7 (44.7 g, 143 mmol)
and D-alanine methyl ester hydrochloride (22.0 g, 1.1 eq.) in acetic acid
(1000 mL) was added portion-wise zinc powder (93.7 g, 10 eq.). The
mixture was heated to reflux for 4 h, then cooled to room temperature.
Following addition of chloroform (1 L), the mixture was filtered and the
filter cake washed with ethanol/chloroform (1:1, 500 mL). The filtrate
was concentrated at 45°C in vacuo to remove acetic acid. The residue was
treated with ethyl acetate (1 L) and filtered to remove insoluble
residue. The filtrate was concentrated and purified by silica gel
chromatography (ethyl acetate/hexane, 40:60 then 60:40) to afford 1.73 g
of fast eluting isomer, 1.77 g of slow eluting isomer (8), and 38.80 g of
mixture containing a 1:1 mixture of both isomers (total yield 42.30 g,
80.5%) as a white solid. Methyl
(2R)-2-{(3S)-3-[4-(benzyloxy)phenyl]-3-methyl-2-oxo-1-pyrrolidinyl}propanoate
(8), yield (42.30 g, 80.5%) 1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 1.46 (d, 3H), 1.53
(s, 3H), 2.07-2.17 (m, 1H), 2.40-2.46 (m, 1H), 3.35 (t, 2H), 3.66 (s,
3H), 4.97 (q, 1H), 5.05 (s, 2H), 6.94 (d, 2H), 7.30- 7.43 (m, 7H); MS
(NH3-CI): m/e 313 (M+H)+; HRMS calcd for C22H26NO4 (M+H)+ 368.1862, found
368.1857; Anal. (C22H25NO4) C, H, N.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM product isolated as a mixt. of isomers
