Quail, Matthew; Lu, Lihui; Wan, Weihua; Albom, Mark S.; Angeles, Thelma
S.; Aimone, Lisa D.; Haltiwanger, R. Curtis; Wells-Knecht, Kevin; Ott,
Gregory R.; Ghose, Arup K.; Ator, Mark A.; Ruggeri, Bruce; Dorsey, Bruce
D.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
