R.; Shaw, Bruce W.; Staszak, Michael A.; Vicenzi, Jeffrey T.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2007), 11(3), 431-440

