$DATUM 2-[6-[(3,5-Dimethylphenylamino)methyl]-2-(1-methylpiperidin-
4-ylamino)benzoimidazol-1-ylmethyl]-6-methylpyridin-3- ol (Compound 26a).
A mixture of 23 (0.0004 mol), 3,5-dimethylaniline (0.00047 mol), BH3CN-
on solid support (0.00047 mol), and CH3CO2H (4 drops) in CH3OH (8 mL) was
stirred at room temperature for 24 h. The solution was filtered. The
filtrate was concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was
purified by column chromatography over silica gel (eluent, CH2Cl2/CH3OH/
NH4OH 87:12:1.5). The pure fractions were collected, and the solvent was
evaporated (0.12 g). The compound was crystallized in CH3CN/DIPE (0.08 g,
42%, melting point 235 °C):
2-[6-[(3,5-Dimethylphenylamino)methyl]-2-(1-methylpiperidin-
4-ylamino)benzoimidazol-1-ylmethyl]-6-methylpyridin-3- ol (Compound 26a).
yield 0.08 g, 42% 1H NMR (DMSO-d6) δ 1.47-1.60 (m, 2 H), 1.97-2.08 (m, 4
H), 2.10 (s, 6 H), 2.20 (s, 3 H), 2.33 (s, 3 H), 2.72-2.80 (m, 2 H),
3.65-3.75 (m, 1 H), 4.20 (d, 2 H, J = 5.5 Hz), 5.10 (s, 2 H), 5.80 (t, 1
H, J = 5.5 Hz), 6.15 (s, 1 H), 6.22 (s, 2H), 6.70-6.75 (m, 1 H), 6.95 (d,
1 H, J = 7.7 Hz), 7.05 (d, 1 H, J = 7.7 Hz), 7.12 (d, 1 H, J = 7.7 Hz),
7.17 (d, 1 H, J = 7.7 Hz), 7.28 (s, 1H), 10.25 (br s, 1 H); HRMS (ESI),
calcd for C29H37N6O 485.3029, found [MH]+ 485.3028.
