$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step1: Ethyl
4-(4-ethoxy-4-oxobutyl)-8-({[(2-methyl-2-propanyl)oxy]carbonyl}amino)-3,4-dihydro-2H-1,4-benzoxazine-2-carboxylate
(13-1) To a solution of 13(2.40 g, 7.50 mmol) in THF (30.0 mL) and acetic
acid (3.36 mL, 15.0 mmol) was added ethyl 4-oxobutanoate (1.87 g, 14.2
mmol) and NaBH(OAc) 3(4.78 g, 22.5 mmol) at 0 °C and the mixture was
stirred for 18 hours at room temperature. The reaction mixture was poured
into water and the resulting mixture was extracted with EtOAc. The
organic layer was washed sequentially with water, saturated aqueous
sodium bicarbonate solution and saturated brine, dried over anhydrous
sodium sulfate and concentrated. The residue was purified by column
chromatography on silica gel (n-hexane/ EtOAc) to give 13-1. Yield 2.90
g, 85%. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.22-1.28 (m, 6H), 1.51 (s, 9H),
1.85-1.94 (m, 2H), 2.34 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 2H), 3.18-3.35 (m, 2H), 3.50 (d,
J = 3.9 Hz, 2H), 4.08-4.30 (m, 4H), 4.81 (t, J = 3.9 Hz, 1H), 6.38 (dd, J
= 8.4, 1.2 Hz,1H), 6.80 (t, J= 8.4 Hz, 1H), 7.03 (brs, 1H), 7.49 (d, J =
8.4 Hz, 1H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
