$DATUM tert-Butyl
(1s,4s)-4-(2-(2'-((1,4-oxazepan-4-yl)methyl)-4'-hydroxybipheny3-yloxy)-5-fluoronicotinamido)cyclohexylcarbamate
33. Homomorpholine hydrochloride (0.445 g, 1.4 eq), anhydrous sodium
sulfate (3.32 g, 10 eq) and 32 (1.28 g, 1 eq) were suspended in CH2Cl2
(15 mL). Acetic acid (0.14 mL, 1.05 eq) was added and the reaction
mixture stirred at rt for 1 h before sodium triacetoxyborohydride (0.988
g, 2 eq) was added. The mixture was stirred for 1.5 h then diluted with
CH2Cl2 and washed with water, saturated aqueous NaHCO3, water and brine.
The organic was dried (Na2SO4) and concentrated. The crude material was
dissolved in methanol and loaded on to a pre-washed 10 g SCX cartridge
which was washed with methanol. The product was eluted with 1M methanolic
ammonia (50 mL) and the solvent evaporated to give 33. Colorless oil,
yields 0.919 g, 62%. LRMS: m/z 635 [M+H]+.
