(1s,4s)-4-(2-(4'-(((3S,5R)-3,5-Dimethylpiperazin-1-yl)methyl)-2'-(morpholinomethyl)bipheny3-yloxy)-5-fluoronicotinamido)cyclohexylcarbamate
30. 24 (0.280 g, 1 equiv) and cis-2,6-dimethylpiperazine (51 mg, 1 equiv)
were stirred in CH2Cl2 (10 mL) for 15 min. AcOH (51 μL, 2 equiv) was
added, followed by sodium triacetoxyborohydride (0.188 g, 2 equiv), and
the reaction stirred for a further 20 h. The reaction was quenched with
aqueous 2 M HCl, extracted with EtOAc, washed with water and brine, dried
(Na2SO4), and concentrated to give 30. Light-brown foam, yield 0.310 g,
96%. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3, δ): 8.36 (dd, J = 8.2, 3.1 Hz, 1H), 8.06 (d,
J = 3.2 Hz, 1H), 8.02 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.50 (t, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H),
7.40−7.27 (m, 5H), 7.19−7.11 (m, 1H), 4.57−4.41 (m, 1H), 4.23−4.10 (m,
1H), 3.68−3.59 (m, 1H), 3.59−3.50 (m, 6H), 3.42 (s, 2H), 3.09−2.95 (m,
2H), 2.74−2.85 (m, 2H), 2.40−2.27 (m, 4H), 1.90−1.59 (m, 8H), 1.58−1.46
(m, 2H), 1.42 (s, 9H), 1.10 (d, J = 6.3 Hz, 6H).
