chromatographed on a silica gel column (1.05” × 23”).
5-[[N-(4-Pyridyl)methyleneamino]-2-phenylbenzoyl]leucine Methyl Ester.
This was prepared by a similar route to GGTI-2132, using
2-phenyl-5-aminobenzoylleucine methyl ester hydrochloride (0.50 g, 1.47
mmol), pyridine-4-carboxaldehyde (0.164 g, 1.53 mmol), and NaCNBH3 (0.16
g, 2.56 mmol). A yellowish solid (0.40 g, 63%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3)
0.76 (m, 6 H), 1.10-1.17 (m, 2 H), 1.27-1.32 (m, 1 H), 3.62 (s, 3 H),
4.43-4.53 (overlapping m & s, 3 H), 5.60 (d, 1 H), 6.61-6.65 (dd, 1 H),
6.97 (d, 1 H), 7.13 (d, 1 H), 7.25-7.35 (m, 8 H), 8.55 (m, 2 H).
