$DATUM 9-(2-Pyridylmethyl)-3-methylene-1,5-bis(p-toluenesulfonyl)-1,5,9-triazacyclododecane
(98-037). A solution of 0.49 g (0.93 mmol) of 94-129, 0.54 mL (0.61 g,
5.7 mmol) of 2-pyridinecarboxaldehyde, and 0.15 g (2.4 mmol) of sodium
cyanoborohydride in 25 mL of methanol was stirred at room temperature for
40 h. The resulting white precipitate was removed by filtration, then
washed with cold methanol, followed by water. Recrystallization from
methanol/chloroform gave 0.32 g (59%) of 98-037 as white crystals, mp
202.5-203 °C. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.47 (d, J = 3 Hz, 1 H, 6-Py),
7.66 (d, J = 8 Hz, 4 H, o-Ts), 7.60 (m, 1 H, 4-Py), 7.31 (d, J = 8 Hz, 4
H, m-Ts), 7.21 (d, J = 8 Hz, 1 H, 3-Py), 7.13 (m, 1 H, 5-Py), 5.22 (s, 2
H, C=CH2), 3.85 (s, 4 H, H2, H4), 3.58 (s, 2 H, CH2Py), 3.14 (t, J = 6
Hz, 4 H, H6, H12), 2.44 (bm, 10 H, ArCH3, H8, H10), 1.67 (m, 4 H, H7,
H11). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 160.0, 149.3, 143.6, 139.1, 136.3, 136.2,
130.0, 127.6, 123.1, 122.1, 116.2, 61.1, 51.5, 50.3, 44.5, 25.1, 21.7. IR
(KBr) 2949 (w), 2838 (w), 1597 (m), 1145 (m), 1329 (s), 1164 (s), 1091
(s), 1038 (m), 930 (s), 910 (m), 822 (s), 744 (s), 689 (s), 555 (s). MS
(3 kV) m/z 583 (MH+). Anal. Calcd for C30H38N4O4S2: C, 61.83; H, 6.57; N,
9.61. Found: C, 61.63; H, 6.65; N, 9.53.
