$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A mixture of 24s (2.16 g, 7.66 mmol) and
1-ethoxycyclopropyloxytrimethylsilane (2.6 mL, 13.0 mmol) in a 1:1
mixture of AcOH and MeOH (32 mL) was heated at 90 °C for 1 h. After
azeotropic distation with toluene to remove the excess of
1-ethoxycyclopropyloxytrimethylsilane, the residue was re-dissolved in a
1:1 mixture of AcOH and MeOH (32 mL). To this solution was added NaBH3CN
(964 mg, 15.3 mmol) at room temperature, and the mixture was stirred at
70 °C for 1.5 h. After the bulk of the solvent was removed under reduced
pressure, the residue was diluted with EtOAc. The mixture was extracted
with H2O (x 3). The aqueous extracts were basified by addition of NaHCO3,
followed by extraction with EtOAc. The combined organic extracts were
washed with H2O and brine, dried over Na2SO4 and concentrated in vacuo.
The residue was washed with MeOH to give the title compound 25s. Yield
1.56 g, 63%.
6-(Cyclopropylamino)-7-fluoro-4-(3-methoxypropyl)-2,2-dimethy2H-benzo[b][1,4]oxazin-3(4H)-one
(25s). LC-MS (condition C): [M+H]+= 322, t = 3.74 min. 1 (400 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 6.83 (d, J = 8.1, 1 H), 6.65 (d, J = 11.1, 1 H), 4.19 (br, 1
H), 4.00 (t, J = 7.1, 2 H), 3.44 (t, J = 6.1, 2 H), 3.34 (s, 3 H), 2.39 -
2.44 (m, 1 H), 1.91 - 1.97 (m, 2 H), 1.45 (s, 6 H), 0.74 - 0.79 (m, 2 H),
0.54 - 0.58 (m, 2 H).
