Meloni, David J.; Waltermire, Robert E.; Wethman, Robert G.; Yates,
Mathew
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2010), 14(1), 159-167

