$DATUM 6-Benzyloxymethyl-5-[4-(4-chloro-benzylamino)-phenyl]-pyrimidine-2,4-diamine.
To a solution of pyrimidine-2,4-diamine (1.62 g, 5.05 mmol) in 1 M
NaOAc/HOAc in MeOH (80 mL, pH 4) was added 4-chlorobenzaldehyde (851 mg,
6.06 mmol). The resulting mixture was stirred for 15 min followed by slow
addition of NaBH3CN (375 mg, 6.06 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred
for 16 h at 25 °C. The product was diluted with EtOAc (80 mL) and washed
with 1.2 M HCl (75 mL), 2 M NaOH (2 x 100 mL), and brine (100 mL). The
crude material was purified by silica gel chromatography (EtOAc to 10%
MeOH in EtOAc
gradient).6-Benzyloxymethyl-5-[4-(4-chloro-benzylamino)-phenyl]-pyrimidine-2,4-diamine,
yield 1.56 g, 70%. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ7.33-7.47 (m, 4H),
7.21-7.30 (m, 3H), 7.14-7.20 (m, 2H), 6.89(d, J = 8.5 Hz, 2H), 6.60 (d, J
= 8.5 Hz, 2H), 6.37 (t, J = 5.9 Hz,1H), 5.87 (s, 2H), 5.48 (s, 2H), 4.32
(s, 2H), 4.27 (d, J = 6.1 Hz,2H), 3.94 (s, 2H). MS (ESI) m/z ) 446 [M +
H]+, 444 [M - H]-.Anal. (C25H24ClN5O.0.2 CH3OH) C, H, N.
