$DATUM 6-[(3S,4S)-4-Methyl-1-(pyrimidin-2-ylmethyl)pyrrolidin-3-yl]-1-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)-1,5-dihydro-4H-pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-4-one
(20). To a solution of 6-[(3S,4S)-4-methylpyrrolidin-
3-yl]-1-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-4(5H)-one
hydrogen chloride (7.75 g) in dimethylformamide (115 mL) were added iron
triflate (900 mg), 2-(chloromethyl)pyrimidine hydrogen chloride (4.5 g),
and cesium carbonate (22.2 g), and the reaction mixture was heated at 60
°C for 24 h. The reaction mixture was concentrated onto silica gel and
purified by flash chromatography, eluting with 0-15% methanol/ethyl
acetate/1% saturated ammonium hydroxide to provide the title compound.
Yield 6 g. 400 MHz 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 12.30 (s, 1H), 8.63 (d, J = 5.0, Hz,
2H), 8.03 (s, 1H), 7.20 (d, J = 5.0, Hz, 1H), 4.84-4.79 (m, 1H),
4.30-4.27 (m, 1H), 4.14- 4.08 (m, 2H), 3.87-3.82 (m, 1H), 3.63-3.55 (m,
2H), 3.47 (t, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H), 3.29 (d, J = 9.9 Hz, 1H), 2.88-2.86 (m,
1H), 2.60-2.56 (m, 1H), 2.46-2.24 (m, 4H), 1.93-1.84 (m, 2H), 1.24 (t, J
= 7.1 Hz, 3H). MS: M + H m/z = 396.2. Anal. Calcd for C20H25N7O2: C,
60.74%; H, 6.37%; N, 24.79%. Found: C, 60.56%; H, 6.43%; N, 24.61%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
