$DATUM Keto acid 2 (60 g, 0.353 mol), NH4Cl (64.2 g, 1.2 mol), glucose (86.4 g,
0.48 mol), Na2CO3 (12.72 g, 0.12 mol), NADP (458 mg, 0.60 mmol), glucose
dehydrogenase (Amano, 67 mg, 10490 U), D-AADH-102 (Biocatalytics, 600 mg,
2129 U) in 975 mL of water were incubated for 19 h in a 2-L reactor at 30
°C, pH 9 (maintained by addition of 5 N NaOH from a pH stat). The
solution yield was 50.5 g (84%) and the ee was 100%. Ketoacid, yield:
94%.
