(d, J = 7.4 Hz, 1H), 7.26 (dd, J = 7.6, 7.4 Hz, 1H), 7.31 (d, J = 7.6 Hz,
1H), 7.42 (s, 1H). As an oxalate salt: white powder, mp= 191 °C; HPLC
purity 97% (eluent, acetonitrile/water/KH2PO4, 400: 600:6.8 g, pH 4); IR
