$DATUM {4-[({3-[3-Benzyl-8-(trifluoromethyl)quinolin-4-yl]phenyl}amino)methyl]phenyl}
acetic acid (16) 8c (0.39 g, 1.0 mmol) and (4-formyl-phenyl)-acetic acid
methyl ester (0.17 g, 0.96 mmol) were mixed in THF (15 mL) and then
treated with NaBH(OAc)3 (0.43 g, 2.0 mml) and acetic acid (0.5 mL). After
stirring at 40 °C under a N2 atmosphere for 2 h the mixture was quenched
with water and then extracted with ethyl acetate. The organic residue was
purified by silica gel chromatography using 5-50% EtOAc/hexanes as eluent
to provide methyl {4-[({3-[3-benzoyl-8-
(trifluoromethyl)quinolin-4-yl]phenyl}amino)methyl]phenyl}acetate as an
orange solid (0.30 g, 54%): MS (EI) m/z 555.3 (M+H)+; 1H NMR (DMSO-d6): δ
3.61 (s, 3 H), 3.66 (s, 2 H), 4.12 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 2 H), 6.40 (d, J = 6.8
Hz, 2 H), 6.49 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 2 H), 6.98 (t, J = 7.7 Hz, 1 H),7.18-7.22
(m, 4 H), 7.36 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H), 7.55 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 1 H), 7.59 (d,
J = 9.0 Hz, 2 H), 7.72 (t, J = 8.6 Hz, 1 H), 7.99 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 1 H),
8.30 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 1 H), 9.08 (s, 1 H).
