$DATUM 1-[2-cis(±)-(4-Azido-3-hydroxypiperidin-1-yl)ethyl]-2-oxo-1,2-dihydroquinoline-7-carbonitrile
(32). A mixture of 34 (4.44 g, 20.91 mmol) and 31 (3.27 g, 23 mmol) in
THF (200 mL) was heated under stirring at 75 °C for 3 h. The mixture was
cooled to room temperature and sodium triacetoxyborohydride (13.30 g,
62.73 mmol) was added. It was stirred for 2 h at room temperature, then
quenched by addition of methanol (100 mL). The reaction mixture was
stirred overnight, filtered through a 0.45 μm membrane, and the solid
residue was washed with MeOH/dichloromethane (1:3, 2 × 20 mL). The
filtrate and wash were combined and concentrated to dryness under reduced
pressure. Chromatography was done on silica gel with hexanes/ acetone
(1:1 to 1:2). Fractions containing product were pooled and concentrated
under reduced pressure to give the product. Colorless solid, yield 3.43
g, 49%. MS (ESP) m/z 339 (MH+); 1H NMR (DMSO-d6) δ 1.56 (m, 1H); 1.71 (m,
1H); 2.25-2.63 (m, 6H); 3.67 (m, 2H); 4.35 (dd, 2H); 5.06 (m, 1H); 6.78
(d, 1H); 7.64 (dd, 1H); 7.90 (d, 1H); 8.00 (d, 1H); 8.08 (br s, 1H).
