$DATUM di-tert-butyl
(2-{[1-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)azetidine-3-yl]amino}phenyl)propanedioate
(19). To a solution of di-tert-butyl (2-aminophenyl)propanedioate (18)
(5.0 g, 16.24 mmol), tert-butyl 3-oxoazetidine-1-carboxylate (3.61 g,
21.12 mmol), Ti(OiPr)4 (6.92 g, 24.36 mmol) and AcOH (1.46 g, 24.36 mmol)
was added NaBH(OAc)3 (5.16 g, 24.36 mmol) and stirred for 4.5 h at
reflux. 4 M aq NaOH soln and CHCl3 were added to the reaction mixture and
filtrated. The filtrate was washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4 and
filtrated The filtrate was concentrated in vacuo and the residue was
purified by silica gel column chromatography (hexane-EtOAc) to give the
title compound. Compound 19 as a pale yellow oil, yield 4.90 g, 65%. 1H
NMR (CDCl3, δ ppm): 7.48 (d, J = 6.3 Hz, 1H), 7.15-7.27 (m, 2H),
6.73-6.76 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 4.83 (s, 1H), 4.74-4.76 (m, 2H), 4.69 (s,
1H), 4.54-4.57 (m, 2H), 1.44-1.48 (m, 27H). MS (ESI) m/z: 463 (M+H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
