$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):SOL(1):CAS_RN
$DATUM 75-09-2
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A solution of morpholine 41 (1.007 g, 1.77 mmol) and N-Boc-3-azetidinone
(0.572 g, 3.35 mmol) in CH2Cl2 was added to a flask containing activated
4 Å molecular sieves (1.18 g). Acetic acid (0.20 mL, 0.21 g, 3.50 mmol)
was added and the mixture was stirred at room temperature for 2 h, then
NaBH(OAc)3 (0.700 g, 3.30 mmol) was added and the reaction mixture was
stirred for an additional 2.5 h, then partitioned between CH2Cl2 and a
saturated aqueous solution of NaHCO3. The aqueous phase was back
extracted with additional CH2Cl2 and the combined organic phases were
dried over Na2SO4, filtered and concentrated to provide crude
Boc-azetidine S64. Yield 1.536 g. MS (ESI +): m/z [M+H]+ = 759.4.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM molecular sieves used in stage 1
